{"id":"58b618e19527154c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-n-fpf.md","title":"有限跳跃等价与n不动点自由","display":"df-n-fpf — 有限跳跃等价与n不动点自由","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-n-fpf","aliases":["43-df-n-fpf"],"display":"df-n-fpf — 有限跳跃等价与n不动点自由","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Definitions 11.12.1–11.12.2","source_printed_pages":"279","source_pdf_pages":"299","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-n-fpf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-n-fpf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-n-fpf — 有限跳跃等价与n不动点自由"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definitions 11.12.1–11.12.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"279"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"299"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 总定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>、迭代跳跃与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\triangle B\">\\(A\\triangle B\\)</span> 是对称差；下式定义关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_n\">\\(\\sim_n\\)</span> 及谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\sim_0B\\iff A=B,\\qquad A\\sim_1B\\iff|A\\triangle B|&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\sim_0B\\iff A=B,\\qquad A\\sim_1B\\iff|A\\triangle B|&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\sim_nB\\iff A^{(n-2)}\\equiv_TB^{(n-2)}\\quad(n\\ge2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\sim_nB\\iff A^{(n-2)}\\equiv_TB^{(n-2)}\\quad(n\\ge2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)\\iff\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg(W_{f(x)}\\sim_nW_x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)\\iff\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg(W_{f(x)}\\sim_nW_x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>n=0正是通常FPF；n=1比较模有限等价；n≥2比较第n−2次跳跃的Turing度。三种分支分离，避免在n=0或1出现负次跳跃。没有把二值DNC与本定义的任意自然数值FPF函数混同。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Definitions 11.12.1–11.12.2；印刷页279，PDF页299。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$W_e$、迭代跳跃与 $\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$A\\triangle B$ 是对称差；下式定义关系 $\\sim_n$ 及谓词 $\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$W_e$、迭代跳跃与 $\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$A\\triangle B$ 是对称差；下式定义关系 $\\sim_n$ 及谓词 $\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$W_e$、迭代跳跃与 $\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$A\\triangle B$ 是对称差；下式定义关系 $\\sim_n$ 及谓词 $\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\triangle B","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\sim_0B\\iff A=B,\\qquad A\\sim_1B\\iff|A\\triangle B|<\\infty.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\sim_nB\\iff A^{(n-2)}\\equiv_TB^{(n-2)}\\quad(n\\ge2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)\\iff\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg(W_{f(x)}\\sim_nW_x).","display":true}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-n-fpf]] — 有限跳跃等价与n不动点自由"},{"id":"1a95499a684ff3a3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}$、$\\operatorname{NFPF}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-n-fpf]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}